{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash unstoppable momentum in a wild, physics-driven destruction game where you become the <strong>rolling force of chaos against Viking settlements</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not a warrior with an axe; you <i>are</i> the weapon. Roll through rugged lands, crushing longhouses, watchtowers, and fortresses owned by greedy Vikings. Every building you smash fuels your hunger for destruction, but beware: each strike drains your energy. Miscalculate, and you\u2019ll fizzle out before toppling their empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destructive Rolling Gameplay</strong> - Become a living snowball and flatten Viking villages in style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Growth Orbs</strong> - Absorb mystical orbs to grow larger, stronger, and more unstoppable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Energy Management</strong> - Every crash cost power. Plan carefully and choose your targets wisely to keep rolling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Viking Strongholds</strong> - From tiny huts to sprawling fortresses, the bigger they are, the harder (and more satisfying) they fall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic Physics Fun</strong> - Buildings shatter, debris flies, and Vikings panic as you roll through their world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the momentum to wipe their empire from the map, or will you crumble before their last fortress stands?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3341200?t=1759932048","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341200/7c8b0e8a67fb21724ffb1e057f759240d819c10b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759932048","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341200/a677068ec60c29179dcf